{"id":"0a047c291d67a9f2","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion.md","title":"不交并终止的坍缩复制准则","display":"thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion — 不交并终止的坍缩复制准则","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion","aliases":["56-thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion"],"display":"thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion — 不交并终止的坍缩复制准则","depends_on":["[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","[[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_section":"§5.9 Theorems 5.9.7, 5.9.9","source_printed_pages":"176–178","source_ocr_blocks":[197,198,199],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-disjoint-union-termination-criterion — 不交并终止的坍缩复制准则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8133fc32a2cf7026\" href=\"?note=8133fc32a2cf7026\" title=\"56-df-collapsing-duplicating\">56-df-collapsing-duplicating</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.9 Theorems 5.9.7, 5.9.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"176–178"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>197</span><span>198</span><span>199</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i\">\\(\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i\\)</span> 及并系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,R,T,\\to\">\\(\\Sigma,R,T,\\to\\)</span>；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminating}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Collapsing}\">\\(\\operatorname{Collapsing}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Duplicating}\">\\(\\operatorname{Duplicating}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8133fc32a2cf7026\" href=\"?note=8133fc32a2cf7026\" title=\"56-df-collapsing-duplicating\">56-df-collapsing-duplicating</a>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i,D_i\">\\(C_i,D_i\\)</span> 为局部命题缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_i\\iff\\operatorname{Collapsing}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\qquad D_i\\iff\\operatorname{Duplicating}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_i\\iff\\operatorname{Collapsing}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\qquad D_i\\iff\\operatorname{Duplicating}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i)\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_0,\\to_0)\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_1,\\to_1)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad((\\neg C_0\\land\\neg C_1)\\lor(\\neg D_0\\land\\neg D_1)\\lor(\\neg C_0\\land\\neg D_0)\\lor(\\neg C_1\\land\\neg D_1))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_0,\\to_0)\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_1,\\to_1)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad((\\neg C_0\\land\\neg C_1)\\lor(\\neg D_0\\land\\neg D_1)\\lor(\\neg C_0\\land\\neg D_0)\\lor(\\neg C_1\\land\\neg D_1))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>陈述与 Theorem 5.9.7 的三个情形逐项对应：双方都不坍缩；双方都不复制；某一个分量同时不坍缩且不复制。核对了原书 5.9.9 的最小层数反例和多重集范数证明：若并系统不终止，就有一个分量复制、另一个分量坍缩。此处用其逆否命题合并为一个公式。未把整个层结构引理链展开成独立原子，故不把这一简述当作完整自包含的形式证明；没有借此声称一般终止性具有模块性。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-collapsing-duplicating","status":"resolved","id":"8133fc32a2cf7026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 